 "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#b48ce8\">Siglo XX</b><br><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f1ecf7\">Todo estalla: jazz, rock, electrónica, cine. Las reglas se rompen.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#b48ce8\">20th century</b><br><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f1ecf7\">Everything explodes: jazz, rock, electronic, film. The rules are broken.</span>",
